{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Scan area for object, if visible approach it, take object if not too heavy, move to destination, perform task, repeat. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = ContinueScanning    />",
